{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person driving adventure and survival game set in a world buried beneath endless snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden, mysterious blizzard, civilization has fallen silent. You drive a heavily modified steam-powered truck, heading north toward the rumored origin of the Great Frostfall. The cold is a constant enemy, gnawing at your body and your machine alike. Your boiler, water tank, and fragile mechanical components demand constant care, and the forests and ruins buried beneath the drifts may hold the only supplies left to keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This steam truck is your only home in a frozen world:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/3d5f587418c2240109adbf7857f7ea34.avif?t=1771122230\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the boiler running with a steady supply of fuel:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/4e5a8e74f50830115a3fb56bdd88aae1.avif?t=1771122230\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade vital components of your truck to improve endurance and performance:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/bedbfa5d67686258dc44c7ae14c65416.avif?t=1771122230\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a shelter on the truck\u2019s rear platform to survive the nights:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/63b333aa31f924e9372f1cd8bda51865.avif?t=1771122230\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, scavenge, cook, craft, and forge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/0b1d754c619154951fdc4f43146d5d70.avif?t=1771122230\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wind never stops, and the white horizon stretches forever. Somewhere in that silence lies the truth of what happened to the world. How far will you go into the snow? What will you uncover beneath the drifts? And when you reach the end of the world, will you finally find the answers you\u2019ve been searching for?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728790?t=1771122230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728790?t=1771122230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/b91ffa55de0fe40305c28f65ae1b8599acd8caf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771122230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/b91ffa55de0fe40305c28f65ae1b8599acd8caf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771122230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person driving adventure and survival game set in a world buried beneath endless snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden, mysterious blizzard, civilization has fallen silent. You drive a heavily mod